# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# ai-06-restrepo — root .gitignore
# NOTE: lean/ is the AppliedModelingLib-generated folder. It ships
# its own .gitignore, which must be respected. The negations at the
# bottom make sure these root rules never hide files inside lean/.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

# LaTeX build artefacts
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.nav
*.snm
*.vrb
*.synctex.gz
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.bbl
*.blg
*.bcf
*.run.xml

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/

# Lean sandbox build cache (lives on the Linux disk; never commit)
extra/lean-sandbox/.lake/
extra/lean-sandbox/lake-packages/

# The article itself: third-party PDF, fetch it from NBER (see paper/README.md)
paper/*.pdf

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*:Zone.Identifier

# Never commit personal documents to a public teaching repository
DNI*
*_DNI*

# Do not let any rule above hide files inside the generated lean/ folder;
# lean/.gitignore (generated) decides what is ignored there.
!lean/**
